## Key Principles Validated

✅ **Subject-First Classification** — Primary subject always overrides context  
✅ **Animal Priority Confirmed** — Animals always override humans  
✅ **Botanical Clarity** — Flowers vs fruits distinction  
✅ **Wheels Section** — Vehicle as primary subject (even on street)  
✅ **Path Precision** — Road must be visible + recognizable + primary  
✅ **Architecture Simplified** — Buildings vs idols distinction  
✅ **Composition Expanded** — People as compositional elements  
✅ **Visual Dominance** — No intent-reasoning errors  

